{"seq":15,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:13:11.426Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"667a0aa94d1d3b95460cd2adc4672b9ae940f877387104bd334d5719c654e66c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account before. The 5/3 Sunday prep says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment was effective 2026-05-04. So the change date is May 4, 2026.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management of it that day. Earlier digests (7/7/25, 12/1/25) already called it Gideon's fleet account, so I'd check that wording before you put a date on it.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30/26 digest has Orlavine at 55 seats and calls it \"Gideon's medical account\". It was Nadia's in the 3/10/25 digest, and no digest dates that handoff.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor/retail account and never name who runs it. The latest one (9/30) has Nadia hosting a training session for them, but that doesn't say she owns the account. Please check the CRM or ask Nadia.\n\nThe Vantorre Group date is the only handoff date the digests give.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:13:16.873Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"528daccaf03b4ef4e8ef13ee90fcc8b56f29fba27f65395eefe8fcd13c10732e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied in the #strategic-pod thread with what Moss's digests show. Three of the four owners are clear. Quillfeather isn't.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato, taking over from Nadia Fennimore. The 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment was effective that day. The change date is May 4, 2026.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he assumed management that day. Digests from 7/7/25 and 12/1/25 already called it Gideon's fleet account, so check that before you put a date on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account\". The 3/10/25 digest had it as Nadia's, and no digest dates that handoff.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor/retail account. The 9/30 digest has Nadia hosting a training session for them, but that doesn't make her the owner. The CRM or Nadia would settle it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
